is place? Did you sense the consciousness of Paradeus or something?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dandelion","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"\"Only through connection did I finally understand that I could not become she who was expected.\" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"\"But her choice to accept all of us, to abandon her wish to become perfect was also what I wanted.\" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"\"The flowers of despair are about to bloom. There is little time.\""}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"HK416Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"416","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I don't care how important that's supposed to be. I need you to cover me, ST AR-15!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Got it!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"ST AR-15 shakes off Dandelion's hand and catches up with 416."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MorridowNew","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Morridow","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I have a suggestion— "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Don't try to resist those pathetic minds. The more of them you kill, the stronger they become... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Until they devour every last one of you Dolls."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Get ready for battle! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Hailing all Muromets units! Taraxacum has engaged the enemy. It's Morridow! Requesting reinforcements!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]}]}
